{"id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-regressive-function.md","title":"Regressive Function","display":"df-regressive-function — Regressive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-regressive-function","aliases":["58-df-regressive-function","58-df-regressive"],"display":"df-regressive-function — Regressive Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-regressive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-regressive-function</span><span>58-df-regressive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regressive-function — Regressive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span> (set of ordinals, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(f)=S\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=S\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\)</span> (ordinal-valued set function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\\)</span> (regressive predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\leftrightarrow \\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\leftrightarrow \\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>58-df-regressive</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed"